    "会联网查询当前 CNY→JPY 汇率，并用新汇率重新折算原价和邮费。保存后，这个汇率会作为这条裙装记录的当时汇率。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app will fetch the current CNY to JPY exchange rate and recalculate the original price and shipping. After saving, this rate is stored with this dress item record."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "会联网查询当前 CNY→JPY 汇率，并用新汇率重新折算原价和邮费。保存后，这个汇率会作为这条裙装记录的当时汇率。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
